<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa ends mixed, coffee off lows.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa ends mixed, coffee off lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Ends mixed after losing earlier gains on lack of follow-through buying. Sept one stg lower at 1,038 stg.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Ends down on early NY weakness, but well off lows. Sept down $13 at $1,785 after a low of $1,755.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Stays tightly mixed in PM, lacking direction. Aug 60 cents higher at $319.80 at 1602 GMT.</p>
</text>
